WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.461
Bu qismda birinchi tartibli tenglamaning geometrik ma’nosini ko‘ramiz,

2
00:00:05.461 --> 00:00:11.078
Koshi masalasini yechamiz va yechim qachon yagona bo‘lishini aniqlaymiz.

3
00:00:11.328 --> 00:00:19.140
y shtrix teng f x y tenglama har bir nuqtada yechim grafigiga urinmaning qiyaligini beradi.

4
00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:24.977
Shu qiyaliklardagi kichik kesmalar yo‘nalish maydonini hosil qiladi.

5
00:00:24.977 --> 00:00:29.870
Integral chiziq har bir nuqtada maydon kesmasiga urinadi.

6
00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:35.240
Maydonni qo‘lda chizish uchun izoklinalardan foydalaniladi.

7
00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:39.840
Izoklina — qiyalik bir xil bo‘lgan nuqtalar chizig‘i.

8
00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:46.262
Bu tenglamada izoklinalar markazi koordinata boshida bo‘lgan aylanalardir.

9
00:00:46.512 --> 00:00:54.367
Koshi masalasi: y shtrix teng ikki y, boshlang‘ich shart y nol teng uch.

10
00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:57.858
Umumiy yechim C e daraja ikki x.

11
00:00:57.858 --> 00:01:03.313
x nolga teng bo‘lganda y teng C, demak C teng uch.

12
00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:07.022
Javob: y teng uch e daraja ikki x.

13
00:01:07.272 --> 00:01:16.547
Pikar teoremasi: agar f va uning y bo‘yicha xususiy hosilasi boshlang‘ich nuqta atrofidagi to‘rtburchakda uzluksiz bo‘lsa,

14
00:01:16.547 --> 00:01:19.892
Koshi masalasining yechimi mavjud va yagona.

15
00:01:19.892 --> 00:01:25.214
Diqqat qiling: bu kafolat faqat boshlang‘ich nuqtaning yaqin atrofida.

16
00:01:25.464 --> 00:01:28.624
Shart bajarilmasa nima bo‘ladi?

17
00:01:28.624 --> 00:01:34.944
y shtrix teng uch y ning uchdan ikki darajasi, y nol teng nol.

18
00:01:34.944 --> 00:01:39.123
Bu yerda y bo‘yicha hosila nolda cheksiz.

19
00:01:39.123 --> 00:01:48.909
Natijada y aynan nol ham, istalgan nuqtadan keyin boshlanadigan kub parabola ham yechim bo‘ladi.

20
00:01:48.909 --> 00:01:50.846
Yagonalik buziladi.

21
00:01:51.096 --> 00:01:53.525
Endi o‘zingizni tekshiring.

22
00:01:53.525 --> 00:01:58.022
Savolni o‘qing va videodan pastda javobni tanlang.
